    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about a list of numbers. it's the shame. my parents, my friends... they'd look at me and just see a failure. i'm 35 and i've basically ruined everything. i wake up and i already want to crawl back under the covers and never come out. it's like there's just this huge, dark wall in front of me and every direction i turn is just another dead end. i'm just so tired of fighting something that clearly isn't going to change.",
